<title>USA: Control Data, Trend Micro in license deal.</title>
<headline>Control Data, Trend Micro in license deal.</headline>
<dateline>CUPERTINO, Calif. 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trend Micro Inc said it has licensed its InterScan VirusWall technology to Control Data Systems Inc for use in Control Data's enterprise-wide security software.</p>
<p>Financial terms of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Trend Micro's InterScan VirusWall technology scans for viruses in Internet e-mail and FTP and HTTP traffic and warns senders, receivers, and network administrators after viruses are found.</p>
<p>Control Data shares closed up 1-7/8 at 25-1/2 following the news.</p>
</text>
